  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Picks up FileExporter 8.0.0, which adds ExportOptions for per-request overrides — localized column headers, an enum label resolver, and explicit file and sheet names — none of which were reachable before, because an ExportRule is a boot-time singleton. It also stamps the file name's timestamp at export time instead of at rule construction, raises the name cap from 30 to 100 characters, substitutes WithName's {DateTime} placeholder instead of shipping it as a literal, rejects an undefined export format explicitly, stops rendering \"7 - \" for undefined enum values, and makes CSV percentages agree with XLSX. No public API break.",
